TITLE 1D transport with exchange, query CaX2 eq fraction at cell 8, step 4

SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial solution in 10 cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals Ca Na Cl

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 10*1
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 8
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 8
    -punch_frequency 1
END
